# Short mW ice/water interface.
# Start: input/traj/interface_f0.lammpstrj (864 molecules, basal slab).
# Engine: LAMMPS pair_style sw, Molinero and Moore mW.
# Ensemble: NVT at the snapshot volume. Timestep 10 fs.
# 10 ps velocity creation at 270 K, then 100 ps production.
# Dump every 10 ps, including the first production step.

units real
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
atom_modify map array

region box block 0 1 0 1 0 1
create_box 1 box
read_dump interface_f0.lammpstrj 0 x y z box yes add yes

mass 1 18.015
pair_style sw
pair_coeff * * mW.sw mW
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

timestep 10.0
thermo 1000
velocity all create 270.0 20261116 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all nvt temp 270.0 270.0 100.0
run 1000
reset_timestep 0
dump 1 all custom 1000 interface.lammpstrj id type x y z
dump_modify 1 sort id first yes
run 10000
